1
00:00:00,594 --> 00:00:04,934
(Howard:)Okay, now you're just being unrealistic.
Anyway, that movie was 20 years ago.

2
00:00:05,099 --> 00:00:07,679
(Howard:)Imagine how saggy
those things would be.

3
00:00:11,647 --> 00:00:14,277
You're gonna throw away a great girl
like Bernadette...

4
00:00:14,441 --> 00:00:17,031
(Penny:)...because you're holding out
for some fantasy?

5
00:00:17,194 --> 00:00:20,784
(Howard:)Hey, just because you settled
doesn't mean I have to.

6
00:00:22,366 --> 00:00:25,286
(Leonard:)Excuse me, I'm sitting here.

7
00:00:25,452 --> 00:00:27,492
(Penny:)Hey, I did not settle for Leonard.

8
00:00:27,663 --> 00:00:31,873
(Penny:)I mean, obviously, he isn't
the kind of guy I usually go out with.

9
00:00:32,084 --> 00:00:34,464
(Penny:)You know, physically.

10
00:00:35,337 --> 00:00:36,587
(Leonard:)Again, I'm right here.

11
00:00:37,631 --> 00:00:41,551
(Penny:)I do not judge a book by its cover.
I am interested in the person underneath.

12
00:00:41,718 --> 00:00:43,718
I am here, right? You see me?

13
00:00:49,351 --> 00:00:52,981
(Howard:)Hey, I'm interested
in what's inside people too.

14
00:00:53,147 --> 00:00:56,317
But, you know, why is it wrong
to want those insides wrapped up...

15
00:00:56,483 --> 00:01:01,023
(Howard:)...in, say, the delicious caramel
that is Halle Berry?

